261106025859.html","showInTree":true,"treeOrder":3,"backlinks":["index.html"],"type":"attachment"},"index.html":{"title":"index","icon":"","description":"\nForever: Dungeon Quest Journey - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/forever-dungeon-journey\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/forever-dungeon-journey</a> / Квесты в данжах\n<br>OpenMap + Questie - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questie\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/questie</a>, <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/openmap\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/openmap</a> / Аналог WoWVendor\n<br>Mastercraft - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/mastercraft\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/mastercraft</a> / Прокачка профессий <br>Shortest Path Forever - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/shortest-path-forever\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/shortest-path-forever</a> / Навигация (корабли, дирижабли и т.д.)\n<br>Dialogue UI - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/dialogueui\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/dialogueui</a> / Меняет стандартное окно взятие квеста (Необязательный)\nWayfarer Voices (Необязательный, но сильно рекомендую):<br>\nСам аддон - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/wayfarer-russian-voiceover\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/wayfarer-russian-voiceover</a><br>\nПаки голосов - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Andrewich/projects\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/Andrewich/projects</a>\n<br>Sixty-ready - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/sixty-ready\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/sixty-ready</a> / XP-Tracker (предсказание через сколько получишь 60лвл)\n<br>Raiderio - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/raiderio\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/raiderio</a> / Mythic + , данжи\n<br>Bagnon - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/bagnon\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/bagnon</a> <br>RXP-Quest-Guides - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/rxp-quest-guides\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/rxp-quest-guides</a> / Пользовательские руководства и инструменты квестов для дополнения RestedXP\n<br>GatherMate2 - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/gathermate2\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/gathermate2</a> / Показывает руды, траву и т.д.\n<br>What's Training? - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/whats-training\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/whats-training</a> / Показывает скиллы которые ты можешь прокачать у тренера <br>Chat - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/chattynator\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/chattynator</a> / UI <br>Timber's Ding Pics - <a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/9ydyr6zr4na9pudesp8cx/TimbersDingPics.zip?rlkey=1by35k773s2cxdbnnfzrr93y1&amp;st=lbnb1my8&amp;dl=0\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/9ydyr6zr4na9pudesp8cx/TimbersDingPics.zip?rlkey=1by35k773s2cxdbnnfzrr93y1&amp;st=lbnb1my8&amp;dl=0\" target=\"_self\">link</a> / Автоматически делать снимок экрана + /played <br>WeakAuras - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/weakauras-2\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/weakauras-2</a> / Мощная комплексная утилита для отображения графики и информации на основе баффов, дебаффов и других триггеров.\n<br>DBM - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/deadly-boss-mods\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/deadly-boss-mods</a> / Лучший помощник в сражениях, который предоставит вам информацию о бое, которую легко обработать с первого взгляда. DBM стремится сосредоточиться на том, что с вами происходит, и на том, что ВАМ нужно с этим делать.\n<br>Bartender4 - <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/bartender4\" target=\"_self\">https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/bartender4</a> / Панель способностей\n<br><img alt=\"left\" src=\"images/pasted-image-20261106004734.png\" target=\"_self\" style=\"width: 27px; max-width: 100%;\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link is-unresolved\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/classes/warrior/fury/talent-builds-pve-dps\" target=\"_self\">Fury Warrior Guide</a> Best DPS Tier List for WoW: Forever<br><img alt=\"Pasted image 20261106025859.png\" src=\"images/pasted-image-20261106025859.png\" target=\"_self\">","a